  "body": "Tender: Closes on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nExperience the ultimate in comfort, style, and convenience with this four-bedroom, three-bathroom terrace home, perfectly positioned in the heart of desirable Devonport.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover:\r\n• Four bedrooms, including a private master suite with en-suite\r\n• Three contemporary bathrooms, offering space and privacy for the whole family\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining area designed for effortless entertaining\r\n• Two sun-drenched balconies, ideal for indoor-outdoor relaxation\r\n• Beautiful seaviews to inspire your everyday living\r\n• A private garden - your own retreat\r\n• Secure double tandem garage with ample storage\r\n\r\nLocation is everything: Enjoy the convenience of community shops at your doorstep, and take leisurely strolls to picturesque Narrow Neck Beach, Waitemata Golf Club, the skate park, and local reserves. Devonport Village—with its boutique shopping, vibrant cafes, and regular ferry service to Auckland CBD—is just a short drive away.\r\nIdeal for families: Zoned for some of Auckland’s most sought-after schools: Belmont Primary, Belmont Intermediate, and Takapuna Grammar.\r\n\r\nThe overseas owner is highly motivated to secure a quality buyer without delay.\r\nContact us now - your new lifestyle awaits!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
